 "key_insight": "Under the breed-first picks RSPCA still has no Staffy page to pick: its 471-URL map names the breed nowhere, and its buying guide, training guide and other fetched pages speak to any dog, with no schema and no animal prices. Its ranking for Staffy buying and price searches rests on a charity's authority and a welfare page this map does not reach; BSUK can meet the same searches with a Staffy-specific buying and price guide that answers the welfare checks RSPCA tells every buyer to make."
